    "updated_at": "2018-05-30T14:11:34Z",
    "body": "Is there any motivation for encouraging such rel proliferation?\r\n\r\nIn general we have plenty of features UAs must handle that authors must not use, e.g. misnested HTML tags, appcache, etc.",
